<view class="chrome-root" style="{{chromeStyle}}"><view class="topbar"><button class="topbar__back {{busy||navigating?'control--disabled':''}}" bindtap="back" disabled="{{busy||navigating}}" aria-label="返回"><image class="topbar__back-icon" src="/assets/icons/arrow-left-ink.svg"/></button><text class="topbar__title">订单详情</text></view><view class="page page--stack detail-page"><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state">正在同步订单事实…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="state state--error"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="load">刷新状态</button></view>
<block wx:if="{{order}}"><view class="order-hero"><text class="eyebrow">{{order.orderNumber}}</text><strong>{{order.statusLabel}}</strong><text wx:if="{{order.status==='pending_payment'}}">支付尚未开放；订单将在 {{order.expiresLabel}} 后由服务端超时处理。</text><text wx:else>这是已保存的终态订单记录。</text></view>
<view class="detail-card"><view class="detail-heading">商品</view><view wx:for="{{order.lines}}" wx:key="id" class="line-item"><image src="{{item.image||'/assets/cisme/community-card-purple-bottle-v1.jpg'}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view><strong>{{item.productName}}</strong><text>{{item.skuLabel}} · ¥{{item.unitPriceYuan}} × {{item.quantity}}</text></view><strong>¥{{item.totalYuan}}</strong></view></view>
<view class="detail-card"><view class="detail-heading">收货信息</view><block wx:if="{{order.address}}"><strong>{{order.address.recipientName}} · {{order.address.phone}}</strong><text class="detail-copy">{{order.addressSummary}}</text></block><text wx:else class="detail-copy">地址快照暂时无法读取，请联系客服。</text></view>
<view class="detail-card money-card"><view><text>商品小计</text><strong>¥{{order.subtotalYuan}}</strong></view><view><text>会员优惠</text><strong>− ¥{{order.discountYuan}}</strong></view><view><text>运费</text><strong>¥{{order.shippingYuan}}</strong></view><view class="money-total"><text>合计</text><strong>¥{{order.totalYuan}}</strong></view></view>
<view class="detail-card"><view class="detail-heading">订单信息</view><text class="detail-copy">创建时间：{{order.createdLabel}}</text><text class="detail-copy">规则版本：{{order.pricingRuleVersion}}</text><text wx:if="{{order.terminalReason}}" class="detail-copy">终态原因：{{order.terminalReason}}</text></view>
<view class="payment-boundary"><image src="/assets/icons/shield-check-plum.svg"/><text>微信支付尚未开放。订单状态以系统记录为准，不会因离开页面而变成已付款。</text></view><button wx:if="{{order.status==='pending_payment'}}" class="secondary danger-action {{busy?'secondary--disabled':''}}" bindtap="cancel" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">取消并释放预留库存</button></block></view></view>
